OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump says united Ireland
OL,4,Awould be a 'great thing' on two-day
OL,5,Avisit to country
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump is in Ireland
OL,8,Fas part of a two-day visit to the
OL,9,Fcountry
OL,11,FHe has landed at Shannon Airport, and
OL,12,Fis on his way to his golf resort in
OL,13,FDoonbeg, County Clare, where the Irish
OL,14,FOpen golf tournament is being held
OL,16,FTrump met earlier with Taoiseach (Irish
OL,17,FPrime Minister) Micheal Martin and
OL,18,FIrish President Catherine Connolly
OL,20,FTraffic is at a standstill in parts of
OL,21,FDublin city centre as protests against
OL,22,Fthe president's visit are taking place
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
