OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump says united Ireland
OL,4,Awould be a 'great thing' on two-day
OL,5,Avisit to country
OL,6,
OL,7,FAsked earlier by reporters about the
OL,8,Fprospect of a unified Ireland, Trump
OL,9,Fsaid he doesn't want to "cause any
OL,10,Fproblems" but thinks it would be a
OL,11,F"great thing", adding: "I'd love to see
OL,12,Fit unified"
OL,14,FNo 10 has responded to the remarks,
OL,15,Fwhile the Democratic Unionist Party
OL,16,Fsays Northern Ireland's constitutional
OL,17,Ffuture "won't be decided by commentary
OL,18,Fin London, Dublin or Washington"
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
